  "mathematical_review": "Boss2 wave15 integrates three pushed UM primary batches ec98/e562/eba (3 linked cores, 7 unique current inputs, 1 new whole edge plus 3 unchanged canonical relations). Four native edge checks and all current receipt/input/asset pins passed. EXT gives the whole positive sparse-flat representation on the target PSD subdomain; its downstream NF role remains only the original-T delta-zero step. Value estimation remains a conditional whole result with an explicit fixed-precision threshold backend. MMO path replacement preserves common-threshold feasibility and weak hardness, not all optimum values. The separate published R18 source-hash correction was independently read and exact-rationally checked; only that pending source change is cleared, while Boss1 primary stays claimed and not completed by this review. See research/workspaces/map-v2/Boss2/recovery-20261112-e8cf4c/wave15-um-root-review.json and research/workspaces/map-v2/Boss2/recovery-20261112-e8cf4c/wave14-r18-source-correction-3d-review.json.",
